    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always seen math as a tool, not a burden. It’s practical, especially in cooking and photography where measuring and proportions matter. I didn’t enjoy it in school as much as literature or chemistry, but I’ve learned to appreciate it when it helps me understand patterns in nature and design. It's not my favorite subject, but I use it on a daily basis.",
